/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * Parity fixture for the source purchase record -- the credit figures a captured build arrived
 * with, preserved verbatim and kept apart from the catalogue retail prices the library computes.
 * `captures` holds, per real capture, the record a build must report and the credit figures a
 * source-record export must write back. `syntheticCaptures` holds hand-written events for shapes
 * the corpus does not contain. `editedExports` pins what an edit does to a source-record export,
 * per capture: a captured figure is pinned to the article it was paid for, so a swapped or removed
 * module exports unpriced and takes the module totals with it, while engineering one or filling an
 * empty mount leaves them standing. The record itself never changes -- no entry here edits it.
 * Cross-language validation.
 */
